# SOC Home Lab

## Overview
This project documents my cybersecurity home lab focused on blue-team operations, detection engineering, Active Directory security, and incident response.

## Technologies
- VMware
- Windows Server
- Active Directory
- Wireshark
- Snort
- Linux
- Windows Event Logs

## Goals
- Practice threat detection
- Improve incident response skills
- Develop detection engineering workflows
- Build hands-on SOC analyst experience

## Planned Projects
- Failed login detection
- Snort IDS alert analysis
- Windows event log investigations
- Security automation scripts
- Active Directory hardening
